/-- Helper for Exercise 16-16.2-3: after the actual left-coordinate action has been scalarized
on a local cyclic `A[P]`-block, it gives the one-block prime-to-`p` scalar decomposition. -/
theorem leftCoordAction_primeToPScalarBlockDecomposition_of_restrictScalars_scalar
    {A : Type u} [CommRing A] [IsLocalRing A]
